Package: GCEstimjmv
Type: Package
Title: Entropy-Based Linear Regression for jamovi
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Jorge",
    family = "Cabral",
    email = "jorgecabral@ua.pt",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(
        ORCID = "0000-0001-5721-4550",
        affiliation = "Department of Mathematics, University of Aveiro"
    )
  )
Description: Provides a jamovi interface for generalized maximum-entropy
    and generalized cross-entropy linear regression using the GCEstim R
    package. The module supports standardized-coefficient- and ridge-informed
    support construction, cross-validation, two-stage re-estimation,
    asymptotic and bootstrap confidence intervals, and diagnostic plots.
